{
  "id": "DEU.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Kūshokeela 9",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ītī kūlwa būtūngīlīja wa Baisilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū igwaga Isilaeli, ī haha ūlī bbihī kūgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani, ūje kūgapeeja mahanga mataale na ga nguzu kūtinda bebe, kū sī ya mizengo mitaale īpīndīlījiwe ngītīli ja ndugu, ja būlīīhu wa kushika kū malunde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba kwenūko balī na nguzu, hangī balīīhu no, ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Anaki. Ū bebe ūbamanile, nīyo ūlūdeebile nū lūkumo lwabo ūmo bakahayīlagwa, “Nani ūyo adūgije kwilwisha na Baanaki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī lelo yenīyī managa hape gīkī, ū SEEBA Mulungu wako hū ng'wene ūyo alīkīla, atonge ko gītī moto gwa būpī gūkūlyaga mabbaala. Akūbakenaagūla wei, akūbagwisha ū kū būtongi wako. Hūna ū bebe ūkūbapeeja na kūbayagaja wangū, gīt'ūmo SEEBA wakwisagīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūlū ūbapeeja būkwīngīla, ūtizikumīlīja ūlīhaya, “Ū SEEBA wanenhile ū mu sī īyī kwiza kwīsola ībize yane kūlwa nguno ya būtūngīlīja wane.” Ītī gīko na hado yaya, alīyo īlī kūlwa nguno ya būsoso wa nhūngwa jabo a banhū ba mahanga genayo, hī chene ū SEEBA alībapeeja bakwīngīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtūjaga kwīsola ī sī ya banhū benabo kūlwa nguno ya būtūngīlīja wako, nūūlū kūlwa būgololoku wa nhūngwa jako. Alīyo īlī kūlwa nguno ya būsoso wa nhūngwa jabo, hī nguno yene ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūbapeeja bakwīngīle, ashikīlīje īyo wabisagīja bakūlūgenji bako ba Abulahamu, Isaka na Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū itegelejage gīkī, ū SEEBA Mulungu wako atūkwinhaga ī sī yawiza yenīyo kwīsola ībize yako, kūlwa nguno ya būtūngīlīja wako; nguno ū bebe ūl'ihanga lya banhū ba nhingo ngang'hanazu no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwizūkījjiwa mawe ga shilagīlo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwizūkagwe ū mhayo ūyū, ūtizīība ūmo ūkampelanīja ū SEEBA Mulungu wako aho ūlī kwitogolo. Kūfuma ikanza lya kwīnga kwako mu sī ya Misili kūshisha washika aha, ūkūnkoyaga dūhū ū SEEBA Mulungu wako, kūlwa būshitiigwa wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū lūgūlū lwa Holebu mukampelanya no ū SEEBA, kūshisha ūhaya kūmuyagaja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nalinha ū mu lūgūlū kūja kwanukūla mabalala ga mawe, a mawe ga būkaanījibo ng'wa SEEBA ūbo walī wabeeja ning'we, nakikala ū mu lūgūlū ikanza lya shikū makūmi anè, līīmi na būjikū; nataliile shilīwa nūūlū natang'wile minzī yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūninha mabalala abīlī ga mawe gandīkilwe na nkono go ng'wa Mulungu. Gaalī gandīkilwe ho pye a malange ga shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA, ayo akang'winha lūshikū lwene ng'walī ng'wibilinga, aho wayombaga ning'we kūfuma mu lūgūlū lūkūligimaga moto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndama ya zahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho jabīta ī shikū ījo makūmi anè līīmi na būjikū, ū SEEBA ūninha mabalala abīlī ga mawe, a mabalala g'ilagane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūniwīla, “Būkaga wike wīnge a henaha ūje wangū, nguno a banhū bako abo wabenhile kūfuma Misili bisosohagije. Baagalūkile wangū no bīīleka īyo naalī nabalagīīlile, bibeegegije shiikolile sha kūsula.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ongeja kūniwīla alīhaya, “Nīyo a banhū benaba naababonile gīkī balī na ntwe ndaamu no! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gete nilekage nabakenaagūle, nalīpyagūle gete ī lina lyabo lyīnge a ha sīlīlī y'igūlū, nakwīte ū bebe ūbize ihanga lya nguzu, n'itaale kūtinda a boi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūgalūka kwika kūfuma ū mu lūgūlū; ī likanza lyenīlo lūkūligimaga moto. Na a mabalala ay'abīlī a g'ilagane naalī nago ū mu makono gane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana aho naaponya a miso nūbona gīkī ng'wang'hūbile no ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we; nūūbona ng'wagalūkile wangū ng'wīleka ī nzīla īyo SEEBA walī wamulagīla, ng'wibeegeja shiikolile sha ndama ya kūsula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mabalala ga mawe ayo naalī nagabūkije mu makono gane, nūgadima nūgaponya hasī mulolile, gūūbelagūka gūbiza mamenyagūlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūūgwa hasī kū būtongi wakwe ū SEEBA nūnīlīīla; nikala gīko ikanza lya shikū makūmi anè, līīmi na būjikū. Natalile shilīwa nūūlū kūng'wa minzī yaya, kūlwa nguno ya būkenaagūji wing'we ū bose ūbo ng'walī ng'wawīta, ī shibi īsho shikampelanya no no no ū SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nakabogoha ū būpelanu nū būdaki wakwe ū SEEBA, walī wasaya no kūshisha walī amalīīlile kūmuyagaja. Alīyo ū SEEBA ūniigwa nū lūkangala lwenūlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nīyo ū SEEBA walī wampelanīla no nū Alooni; walī atogilwe kūnyagaja, nū ng'wene nakanombela ī likanza lyenīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī līshiinū ling'we, ī lidama īlo ng'walī ng'walībeeja nūlīsola nūlīpemba mu moto. Hama nūlīpondagūla, nūlīshigina lyūnoga, lyūbiza lūbuubu; ū lūbuubu lwenūlo nūlūsaamagūlīla mu minzī ga mu longa gaahūūmaga kūfuma mu lūgūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ng'walī ng'wampelanya n'ikanza līngī mulī Tabeela, na Masa, na Kibuloti-havata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a haho mulī Kadeeshi-balinea ū SEEBA akamutūma ūmuwīla, “Jagi mukīdime ībize ying'we, ī sī īyo nang'winha.” Na ahene mukalema, ng'ūshigomela ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we; ng'ūduuma ū kūnsanya nūūlū ū kūng'wigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we mulī bashitiigwa na kale ū kūlī SEEBA, kūfuma aho nandīja kūmudeeba ū nene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa kūbalombela Baisilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nūdīla ī shikū ījo makūmi anè līīmi na būjikū nagwile ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, nguno ū SEEBA walī wahaya akūmuyagaja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
